# The installers for v0.36.0-beta.1 are built by .github/workflows/desktop.yml
# from the tag and attached to the release. This file is filled in from the
# release API once they exist — GitHub's own sha256 digest for each uploaded
# asset, not a hash of a local build folder that could have drifted.
#
#   gh api repos/timetorepo/researchengine/releases/tags/v0.36.0-beta.1 \
#     -q '.assets[] | "\(.digest)" + "  " + .name'
#
# Until then, verify against the release page itself. The digests from
# v0.35.0-beta.1 are deliberately not carried over: an installer that does not
# exist yet has no digest, and pretending otherwise is worse than saying nothing.
